---
import FooterPageLayout from "../layouts/FooterPageLayout.astro";
---

<FooterPageLayout title={"About"}>
    <div class="text-black">
        <p class="text-4xl underline font-bold mb-5">The StackKitDev Curve</p>
        <p class="text-2xl">
            StackKitDev is created with one motivation, providing all important and mostly used developer tools under an umbrella of one website with no signups or storing data / information of any kind with the best User Experience and simplistic User Interface. There are tools for formatting JSON, converting JSON to CSV or CSV to JSON, encoding and decoding Base64 string and URL, JWT decoding, Regex Tester, Timestamp Converter, Timezone Converter, HEX to RGB / RGBA, HSL / HSLA and oklch  and RGB to HEX, HSL / HSLA and Oklch converter but all are available, separately. I thought lets bring everything under one website to make the process more efficient and easy. Also, I made sure that StackKitDev doesnt lack in UX and UI sectors.
        </p>

        <p class="text-2xl mt-5">
            I believe StackKitDev will not be just a hit in developers community, but will be their goto website for the tools.
        </p>

        <p class="text-2xl mt-5 font-bold">
            Now, why I choose only this accumulation of 11 tools under one website? 
         </p>
         
         <p class="text-2xl mb-1">
            Firstly, I wanted to make some money and in this AI age, obviously, claude took away my job, before I even started to search for it. So I thought lets built something, like a tools website as it has only one expense (money to buy domain) and no ceiling of making money. Secondly, I found that this 11 tools are scattered among several website. So yeah.... thats how I came up with the idea of StackKitDev.    
        </p>
    </div>
</FooterPageLayout>